 found no explanations of how Deftera, Triti, or Paraskevi work. For the strain mechanics, the Trauma Center fan wiki (cosimoquiche.github.io/tc-wiki) has per-strain pages like the Kyriaki one, so checking there for the other names would be the next step."],"durationSeconds":9.009534260999994,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Sj86x41qLfXK3tiDcvwFVi","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
